patches (ported to the Hyprland 0.57.2 API, the upstream code does not compile against it):
  - Makefile rewritten: builds build/hyprtrails.so with the installed headers.
  - config values registered with addConfigValueV2 (CFloatValue/CIntValue/CColorValue) instead of addConfigValue.
  - decoration: draw(CRenderContext&, monitor, a, presentation), getDecorationLayer (UNDER), getDecorationFlags
    (NON_SOLID), getDisplayName; created with makeShared; pass element got the CRenderContext overloads and
    boundingBox (whole monitor).
  - window geometry through position()/size(GEOMETRIC_CURRENT), rounding via presentation(), window list via
    Desktop::windowState()->windows(), render data via ctx.m_data, scissor/renderRect/projectBoxToTarget take ctx.
  - glStencilMask(0xFF) before clearing the stencil (same fix as upstream hyprbars).
  - shader sources no longer start with a newline before #version.
  - PLUGIN_EXIT no longer touches the removed m_renderPass; init notification and reloadConfig call dropped.
